## https://vim.rtorr.com
Vim: Delete line (Cut)     | dd
Vim: Start Of line         | 0
Vim: Previous end of line  | ge
Vim: Next End Of Line      | e
Vim: Previous/Next Word    | b/w
Vim: Select paragraph      | vip
Vim: Selete more           | vipipip
Vim: Lowercase/Uppercase   | gu/U
Vim: Swap Case             | g~
Vim: Autoindent            | =
Vim: Indent left/right     | </>
Vim: Copy all to clipboard | {n} %y+